# Telegram supplement (📲 电报消息), loaded before ACL4SSR Telegram.list
# Upstream keeps its PROCESS-NAME lines commented out and misses some ranges from
# https://core.telegram.org/resources/cidr.txt. Telegram clients dial raw DC IPs,
# so the IP ranges and process rules are what actually route them.

# Android
PROCESS-NAME,org.telegram.messenger
PROCESS-NAME,org.telegram.messenger.web
PROCESS-NAME,org.thunderdog.challegram
PROCESS-NAME,tw.nekomimi.nekogram
PROCESS-NAME,org.telegram.plus

# Desktop (Telegram Desktop / macOS Telegram)
PROCESS-NAME,Telegram.exe
PROCESS-NAME,Telegram

# Official ranges missing upstream
IP-CIDR,91.105.192.0/23,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,185.76.151.0/24,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2001:b28:f23c::/48,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2a0a:f280::/32,no-resolve
